other_comments_or_suggestions.value:
There are some suggestions:
1) Algorithm 2 appears crowded and the authors could improve its clarity; 
2) It would be helpful if the authors could color-code the reconstructed texts in Tables 16-21 to better differentiate correct and incorrect results; 
3) It appears that Fig.3 misses the “%”.
4) The introduction of U-LiRA+ is compelling, but consider adding a brief explanation of why mislabeled samples represent a "worst-case scenario" for auditing. This would improve the clarity.
5) The paper lacks a description on compute requirements (e.g., GPU, CUDA).

